  "releaseNotes": "v9.0.1: Unsubscribing now sends the RFC 6455 close handshake; failed handshakes fail fast with the server's status code instead of timing out; send failures now throw at the await site (in addition to the SendError status); the final Disconnected status is delivered; new NegotiatedSubprotocols property; NuGet package no longer double-ships the interface assembly; reconnect requires leaving TcpClient unset (see README). See README for details.",
